          "cells": [
            "N-026",
            "[874](https://github.com/desenlab/desen-protocol/blob/b0bd7c4f0f61555b1d90e3a2ceb90d6e3d43daca/SPEC.md#L874)",
            "Resolved props must validate against the capability schema.",
            "M02-T08, M04-T02, M05-T02",
            "PLANNED",
            "**Current-ledger correction (2026-07-27, PF-049):** the earlier `TESTED` status described M02-T08's static-value checks too broadly. M04-T02 and M04-T16 materialize a complete dynamic candidate but do not validate the resolved prop object against the receiving capability schema. Exact consumer-schema validation, optional omission, required-node failure, and proof that no invalid prop reaches an adapter remain with M05-T02. Immutable task-time artifacts retain their historical status bytes; M04-T17 owns the explicit compatibility migration rather than rewriting them."
          ],
